OL,4,CSchool hit in series of linked copper  
OL,5,Cthefts                                 
OL,6,GA joint investigation has been         
OL,7,Glaunched by Warwickshire Police and    
OL,8,GWest Midlands Police following a       
OL,9,Gseries of copper thefts at sites in    
OL,10,GNuneaton and Coventry.                 
OL,12,FCroft Junior School in Nuneaton was    
OL,13,Fforced to close last week after copper 
OL,14,Fwas stolen from an outbuilding on the  
OL,15,Fpremises, leaving the school without   
OL,16,Fheating or water.                      
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
