OL,4,CAnother big council tax hike could add 
OL,5,C#177 to bills                          
OL,6,GResidents in Shropshire could face a   
OL,7,Gsecond consecutive council tax rise of 
OL,8,Galmost 9%, adding an extra #177 to an  
OL,9,Gaverage annual household bill.         
OL,11,FShropshire Council increased its share 
OL,12,Fof bills by 8.99% in April after       
OL,13,Freceiving rare government permission   
OL,14,Fto exceed the normal cap on council    
OL,15,Ftax rises.                             
OL,17,FA recently published finance report    
OL,18,Fhas recommended that council tax       
OL,19,Fshould be raised again "to the maximum 
OL,20,Fpossible level" permitted by the       
OL,21,Fgovernment in 2027-28.                 
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
